{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/397acc5593f771c3d3a21708d86dfb17.poster.avif?t=1772746227\" width=800 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/397acc5593f771c3d3a21708d86dfb17.webm?t=1772746227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a delirious journey in this metroidvania set on a pirate island where all the characters are sea animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/c961e3b64fab312fc72940623d9b6903.avif?t=1772746227\" width=320 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you will play the role of an alcoholic goldfish in search of the Holy Grail, a legendary bottle of rum that is said to confer immortality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/e457dde2a2dcefba8ec189c9ed3efbe1.avif?t=1772746227\" width=680 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/45b019c036a87cb76ae1961c8e149354.avif?t=1772746227\" width=312 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore Aquarius, a dense and diverse pirate world full of mysterious and secret places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/fde415c56c2e5b06a5e3e86f0de069a8.avif?t=1772746227\" width=680 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/0637a92d417f6022a5a0ff0133c72180.avif?t=1772746227\" width=392 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Aquarius, the pirate code is applied to all creatures, from the largest whale to the smallest plankton.<br>Make friends and do business with in numerous Npc's on the island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/c82c3d72da6716a6ca01a563beb2465c.avif?t=1772746227\" width=680 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/18417fc7c49e8dd71322089f05391069.avif?t=1772746227\" width=320 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your journey you will face numerous enemies with different characteristics and attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/3e266071b0a3e0a5ee67d0de112f9b87.poster.avif?t=1772746227\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462330/extras/3e266071b0a3e0a5ee67d0de112f9b87.webm?t=1772746227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/346